messages.content:
Subscribe: SubscribeToEvent(E_UPDATE, URHO3D_HANDLER(MyClass, HandleUpdate));
Subscribe to specific sender: SubscribeToEvent(button, E_RELEASED, handler);
Lambda: SubscribeToEvent(E_UPDATE, [this](StringHash, VariantMap& data) { ... });
Send: SendEvent(E_MYEVENT, eventData);
Event data: VariantMap — key-value pairs accessed via P_TIMESTEP, P_KEY, etc.
Common events: E_UPDATE (per frame), E_KEYDOWN, E_SCREENMODE, E_BEGINFRAME, E_ENDFRAME.
Network events: E_NETWORKMESSAGE, E_CLIENTCONNECTED, E_CLIENTDISCONNECTED.
Custom: URHO3D_EVENT(E_MYEVENT, MyEvent) { URHO3D_PARAM(P_DATA, Data); }
